00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:19.190
In this modern digital world
powered by smart IoT devices,

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:22.400
hundreds of petabytes of data
are generated every second

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.280
as consumers increasingly
prefer online shopping,

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:28.980
mobile banking, telehealth,
and other digital services.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.710
On the other hand,
organizations are

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.720
looking to harness the
power of this data,

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.970
using tools like
Google Cloud BigQuery

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.910
to deliver personalized
experiences,

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:40.160
