00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:51.650
These include data
residing in silos,

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.740
security concerns over
sharing proprietary data,

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:59.540
and the complexity of
monetizing data consumption.

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.940
This is where APIs can help.

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:04.310
By packaging data
as API products,

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:06.650
